="00:16.690" end="00:16.690">, </span><span begin="00:16.690" end="00:16.960">I </span><span begin="00:16.960" end="00:17.650">fell </span><span begin="00:17.650" end="00:18.520">under </span><span begin="00:18.520" end="00:18.850">your </span><span begin="00:18.850" end="00:19.660">spell</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.660" end="00:23.470"><span begin="00:19.660" end="00:19.750">A </span><span begin="00:19.750" end="00:20.980">love </span><span begin="00:20.980" end="00:21.370">no </span><span begin="00:21.370" end="00:21.550">one </span><span begin="00:21.550" end="00:21.820">could </span><span begin="00:21.820" end="00:23.470">deny</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.950" end="00:28.180"><span begin="00:23.950" end="00:24.550">Don</span><span begin="00:24.550" end="00:24.580">’</span><span begin="00:24.580" end="00:24.700">t </span><span begin="00:24.700" end="00:25.180">you </span><span begin="00:25.180" end="00:25.450">ever </span><span begin="00:25.450" end="00:26.170">say </span><span begin="00:26.170" end="00:26.560">I </span><span begin="00:26.560" end="00:27.040">just </span><span begin="00:27.040" end="00:27.460">walked </span><span begin="00:27.460" end="00:28.180">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.180" end="00:31.330"><span begin="00:28.180" end="00:28.570">I </span><span begin="00:28.570" end="00:29.140">will </span><span begin="00:29.140" end="00:29.800">always </span><span begin="00:29.800" end="00:30.370">want </span><span begin="00:30.370" end="00:31.330">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.020" end="00:36.160"><span begin="00:32.020" end="00:32.530">I </span><span begin="00:32.530" end="00:32.920">can</span><span begin="00:32.920" end="00:32.950">’</span><span begin="00:32.950" end="00:33.010">t </span><span begin="00:33.010" end="00:33.400">live </span><span begin="00:33.400" end="00:33.490">a </span><span begin="00:33.490" end="00:34.090">lie</span><span begin="00:34.090" end="00:34.090">, </span><span begin="00:34.090" end="00:35.020">running </span><span begin="00:35.020" end="00:35.320">for </span><span begin="00:35.320" end="00:35.560">my </span><span begin="00:35.560" end="00:36.160">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.160" end="00:39.910"><span begin="00:36.160" end="00:36.580">I </span><span begin="00:36.580" end="00:37.120">will </span><span begin="00:37.120" end="00:37.810">always </span><span begin="00:37.810" end="00:38.440">want </span><span begin="00:38.440" end="00:39.910">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.780" end="00:44.740"><span begin="00:40.780" end="00:41.020">I </span><span begin="00:41.020" end="00:41.410">came </span><span begin="00:41.410" end="00:41.590">in </span><span begin="00:41.590" end="00:41.890">like </span><span begin="00:41.890" end="00:42.040">a </span><span begin="00:42.040" end="00:43.090">wrecking </span><span begin="00:43.090" end="00:44.740">ball</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.800" end="00:48.490"><span begin="00:44.800" end="00:44.980">I </span><span begin="00:44.980" end="00:45.580">never </span><span begin="00:45.580" end="00:45.820">hit </span><span begin="00:45.820" end="00:46.060">so </span><span begin="00:46.060" end="00:46.900">hard </span><span begin="00:46.900" end="00:47.080">in </span><span begin="00:47.080" end="00:48.490">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.550" end="00:52.480"><span begin="00:48.550" end="00:48.880">All </span><span begin="00:48.880" end="00:49.060">I </span><span begin="00:49.060" end="00:49.570">wanted </span><span begin="00:49.570" end="00:49.870">was </span><span begin="00:49.870" end="00:50.020">to </span><span begin="00:50.020" end="00:50.860">break </span><span begin="00:50.860" end="00:51.070">your </span><span begin="00:51.070" end="00:52.480">walls</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.540" end="00:57.280"><span begin="00:52.540" end="00:52.870">All </span><span begin="00:52.870" end="00:53.170">you </span><span begin="00:53.170" end="00:53.560">ever </span><span begin="00:53.560" end="00:53.890">did </span><span begin="00:53.890" end="00:55.030">was </span><span begin="00:55.030" end="00:56.080">wreck </span><span begin="00:56.080" end="00:57.280">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.520" end="01:01.060"><span begin="00:57.520" end="00:57.850">Yeah</span><span begin="00:57.850" end="00:57.850">, </span><span begin="00:57.850" end="00:59.080">you </span><span begin="00:59.080" end="01:00.070">wreck </span><span begin="01:00.070" end="01:01.060">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.540" end="01:05.680"><span begin="01:01.540" end="01:01.990">I </span><span begin="01:01.990" end="01:02.620">put </span><span begin="01:02.620" end="01:02.950">you </span><span begin="01:02.950" end="01:03.670">high </span><span begin="01:03.670" end="01:04.120">up </span><span begin="01:04.120" end="01:04.600">in </span><span begin="01:04.600" end="01:04.840">the </span><span begin="01:04.840" end="01:05.680">sky</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.680" end="01:09.520"><span begin="01:05.680" end="01:05.800">And </span><span begin="01:05.800" end="01:06.700">now</span><span begin="01:06.700" end="01:06.970">, </span><span begin="01:06.970" end="01:07.270">you</span><span begin="01:07.270" end="01:07.300">’</span><span begin="01:07.300" end="01:07.360">re </span><span begin="01:07.360" end="01:07.570">not </span><span begin="01:07.570" end="01:08.350">coming </span><span begin="01:08.350" end="01:09.520">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.550" end="01:13.660"><span begin="01:09.550" end="01:09.880">It </span><span begin="01:09.880" end="01:10.960">slowly </span><span begin="01:10.960" end="01:11.650">turned</span><span begin="01:11.650" end="01:11.650">, </span><span begin="01:11.650" end="01:11.980">you </span><span begin="01:11.980" end="01:12.520">let </span><span begin="01:12.520" end="01:13.060">me </span><span begin="01:13.060" end="01:13.660">burn</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.660" end="01:17.680"><span begin="01:13.660" end="01:13.750">And </span><span begin="01:13.750" end="01:14.800">now</span><span begin="01:14.800" end="01:14.830">, </span><span begin="01:14.830" end="01:15.070">we</span><span begin="01:15.070" end="01:15.100">’</span><span begin="01:15.100" end="01:15.160">re </span><span begin="01:15.160" end="01:15.670">ashes </span><span begin="01:15.670" end="01:15.910">on </span><span begin="01:15.910" end="01:16.270">the </span><span begin="01:16.270" end="01:17.680">ground</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.920" end="01:22.180"><span begin="01:17.920" end="01:18.520">Don</span><span begin="01:18.520" end="01:18.550">’</span><span begin="01:18.550" end="01:18.760">t </span><span begin="01:18.760" end="01:19.180">you </span><span begin="01:19.180" end="01:19.450">ever </span><span begin="01:19.450" end="01:20.170">say </span><span begin="01:20.170" end="01:20.560">I </span><span begin="01:20.560" end="01:21.040">just </span><span begin="01:21.040" end="01:21.460">walked </span><span begin="01:21.460" end="01:22.180">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.180" end="01:25.180"><span begin="01:22.180" end="01:22.570">I </span><span begin="01:22.570" end="01:23.140">will </span><span begin="01:23.140" end="01:23.830">always </span><span begin="01:23.830" end="01:24.370">want </span><span begin="01:24.370" end="01:25.180">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.020" end="01:30.160"><span begin="01:26.020" end="01:26.530">I </span><span begin="01:26.530" end="01:26.950">can</span><span begin="01:26.950" end="01:26.980">’</span><span begin="01:26.980" end="01:27.070">t </span><span begin="01:27.070" end="01:27.400">live </span><span begin="01:27.400" end="01:27.490">a </span><span begin="01:27.490" end="01:28.090">lie</span><span begin="01:28.090" end="01:28.090">, </span><span begin="01:28.090" end="01:29.020">running </span><span begin="01:29.020" end="01:29.320">for </span><span begin="01:29.320" end="01:29.560">my </span><span begin="01:29.560" end="01:30.160">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.160" end="01:32.590"><span begin="01:30.160" end="01:30.580">I </span><span begin="01:30.580" end="01:31.150">will </span><span begin="01:31.150" end="01:31.810">always </span><span begin="01:31.810" end="01:32.440">want </span><span begin="01:32.440" end="01:32.590">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.830" end="01:36.130"><span begin="01:32.830" end="01:33.040">I </span><span begin="01:33.040" end="01:33.400">came </span><span begin="01:33.400" end="01:33.610">in </span><span begin="01:33.610" end="01:33.910">like </span><span begin="01:33.910" end="01:34.060">a </span><span begin="01:34.060" end="01:35.080">wrecking </span><span begin="01:35.080" end="01:36.130">ball</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.820" end="01:40.240"><span begin="01:36.820" end="01:37.030">I </span><span begin="01:37.030" end="01:37.600">never </span><span begin="01:37.600" end="01:37.840">hit </span><span begin="01:37.840" end="01:38.080">so </span><span begin="01:38.080" end="01:38.890">hard </span><span begin="01:38.890" end="01:39.100">in </span><span begin="01:39.100" end="01:40.240">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.540" end="01:44.230"><span begin="01:40.540" end="01:40.900">All </span><span begin="01:40.900" end="01:41.050">I </span><span begin="01:41.050" end="01:41.590">wanted </span><span begin="01:41.590" end="01:41.860">was </span><span begin="01:41.860" end="01:42.010">to </span><span begin="01:42.010" end="01:42.880">break </span><span begin="01:42.880" end="01:43.090">your </span><span begin="01:43.090" end="01:44.230">walls</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.560" end="01:48.880"><span begin="01:44.560" end="01:44.890">All </span><span begin="01:44.890" end="01:45.160">you </span><span begin="01:45.160" end="01:45.580">ever </span><span begin="01:45.580" end="01:45.880">did </span><span begin="01:45.880" end="01:46.960">was </span><span begin="01:46.960" end="01:48.070">break </span><span begin="01:48.070" end="01:48.880">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.880" end="01:52.750"><span begin="01:48.880" end="01:49.030">I </span><span begin="01:49.030" end="01:49.420">came </span><span begin="01:49.420" end="01:49.600">in </span><span begin="01:49.600" end="01:49.900">like </span><span begin="01:49.900" end="01:50.050">a </span><span begin="01:50.050" end="01:51.100">wrecking </span><span begin="01:51.100" end="01:52.750">ball</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.780" end="01:56.530"><span begin="01:52.780" end="01:53.140">Yeah</span><span begin="01:53.140" end="01:53.140">, </span><span begin="01:53.140" end="01:53.350">I </span><span begin="01:53.350" end="01:53.560">just </span><span begin="01:53.560" end="01:53.890">closed </span><span begin="01:53.890" end="01:54.130">my </span><span begin="01:54.130" end="01:54.880">eyes </span><span begin="01:54.880" end="01:55.060">and </span><span begin="01:55.060" end="01:56.530">swung</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.560" end="02:00.520"><span begin="01:56.560" end="01:56.830">Left </span><span begin="01:56.830" end="01:57.040">me </span><span begin="01:57.040" end="01:57.670">crouching </span><span begin="01:57.670" end="01:57.910">in </span><span begin="01:57.910" end="01:58.000">a </span><span begin="01:58.000" end="01:58.870">blaze </span><span begin="01:58.870" end="01:59.050">and </span><span begin="01:59.050" end="02:00.520">fall</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.580" end="02:05.410"><span begin="02:00.580" end="02:00.880">All </span><span begin="02:00.880" end="02:01.150">you </span><span begin="02:01.150" end="02:01.570">ever </span><span begin="02:01.570" end="02:01.870">did </span><span begin="02:01.870" end="02:02.980">was </span><span begin="02:02.980" end="02:04.030">break </span><span begin="02:04.030" end="02:05.410">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.440" end="02:10.300"><span begin="02:05.440" end="02:05.830">Yeah</span><sp